<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-18T11:28:01.054Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:28:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian drones struck a Komala Kurdish opposition base on the outskirts of Erbil, and a separate explosion hit the same area, while a malfunction caused a blast at a Popular Mobilization Forces ammunition depot that injured five people. A scrap collector was shot dead near a PMF site in Baghdad, and Turkish foreign minister praised Iraqi premier's vision for bilateral ties in Baghdad. These incidents show continued attacks on Iranian-linked opposition groups and PMF facilities alongside diplomatic engagement. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/the-bundestag-has-debated-the-genocide-germany-carried-out-in-namibia-a-century-ago-but-will-it-spur-progress-on-addressing-colonial-crimes/a-79682388&quot;&gt;dw.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;تسنیم&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiREFVX3lxTE15Tms1Sm1GLWkzcVdoRFRneGxzeFRHakVKMHlieVRrOEFITlNrampYY0tYMmtnU1d1TlhzM21OYkpVS0ZM?oc=5&quot;&gt;964media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFA2Z0p0Z3N1bmMzbjdTRG1rSWNId205WC1ZY2hKUGprQVBPNWpiay1PazV1TkpDY0hhZWlZbEU1SFN1UlVEVEt3bGFod0dwQ3l1Mkw0YWczZjk3dFVs?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9hWTVCcXUtTVZhOF95X0xQT3JvV2Zqb2RvLWZwZGhheng1d0hQUW9ZUnI0REJVbnlQa0hGdjJCNWNZUzNISUM2X0Jlb2V6LTJDUXFmR0JDbEliVzNydy1Fd0JyVVN2OTVKa0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNNW1fRWZaeFpBbFk0TFBSSEdNTm9xU05RSkpjR1Z6bVAwdWxBYVFka2k5QXB4dmY4SnBXSGJ0UG93a2Z5VVI5X0NyRUNYOUIzcVhNLXJ4bmFfaWVTYjN0S3A1c2ZRc1Nyb0pyZkhTOWZmTGN5TFl0M3hDSkJCTWw4T0FMdGpJS09HSlpIcnJlZVl5OElsR3d4TXY0cXpLaUlRRXZFMzhjc1NEcDFrTkN0TEwxRmFn